  "description": "Beastyqt said:\nThis build order is very good if the enemy doesn't know how to deal it, once he learns how to deal with it, then it's mid.\n\nIn team games this build order is very good, so use it.\n\nHow to play this?\nDO NOT fear spearmen, with the flasks you'll win the fight. Don't forget to use trample with cataphracts.\nNOTE: After the nerf to the cistern of the first hill this build is a lot weaker, diving under TCs or defeating spearmen is not as easy as it used to be\n(Flask cooldown (how frequently a unit can use the ability) 20→45 (seconds))",
